            <ArticleTitle>Challenges and choices in drug therapy for chronic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>119-21, 125-7, 131-2 passim</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>By treating chronic pain effectively, physicians can improve the quality of their patients' lives considerably. This article reviews the mechanisms and treatment of chronic pain, with emphasis on overcoming the barriers to effective analgesia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
